      "message": "Apologies for the super-late (2 years old) review: what is the rationale of NOT using JGit that does include all the cleanup steps needed by Gerrit?\n\nAre we duplicating the JGit logic into Python here?\nIs there any risk of the two logic to be off sync in the near future?\nHow do we remember to update these Python scripts every time that we update JGit on the maintenance side?",
